# Normalize this project's own files to LF regardless of the client's
# core.autocrlf -- avoids "LF would be replaced by CRLF" fatal errors from
# `git add` on Windows installs with core.safecrlf=true (blocks staging any
# pure-LF text file otherwise, since a future checkout would silently
# convert it). Scoped to this directory only -- not applied repo-wide,
# since the rest of vllm-msn's existing files/conventions aren't ours to
# change.
* text=auto eol=lf
